From 29dbca82d73a3ddbae017cc6ccc8e572dea4e92b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 09:06:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Refresh tdb.keyring from keyservers/WKD: same certificate(s), with
self-signatures our copy was missing. The GnuPG keybox becomes a plain
OpenPGP keyring, which sqv can read.
The commands are in the comment above its Source line.

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 libtdb.spec |   5 ++++-
 tdb.keyring | Bin 1509 -> 10801 bytes
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libtdb.spec b/libtdb.spec
index 6db8588..6b3494c 100644
--- a/libtdb.spec
+++ b/libtdb.spec
@@ -6,7 +6,10 @@ License:         LGPL-3.0-or-later
 URL:             http://tdb.samba.org/
 Source0:         http://samba.org/ftp/tdb/tdb-%{version}.tar.gz
 Source1:         http://samba.org/ftp/tdb/tdb-%{version}.tar.asc
-# gpg2 --no-default-keyring --keyring ./tdb.keyring --recv-keys 9147A339719518EE9011BCB54793916113084025
+# Refreshed from keyservers/WKD (same keys, newer signatures):
+#   sq --home=none network search --output - 9147A339719518EE9011BCB54793916113084025 | sq keyring filter --experimental --cert 9147A339719518EE9011BCB54793916113084025 --output update.pgp
+#   sq keyring merge tdb.keyring update.pgp | sq packet dearmor --output tdb.keyring.new
+#   mv tdb.keyring.new tdb.keyring
 Source2:         tdb.keyring
 
 BuildRequires: make
diff --git a/tdb.keyring b/tdb.keyring
index 5eec19eb00ad34c4a3035ee44fd472bee14bae83..91264ee2b327bcb9a5d7485c02118dd5362385e6 100644
